const e='---\ntitle: "Qingpu AI Tools"\ndescription: "Theme-private async AI tool APIs for text-to-image and shared task polling"\n---\n\n# Qingpu AI Tools API\n\nThis module documents the theme-private Qingpu AI tool APIs that reuse the shared `qingpu_tasks` ledger and `qingpu_assets` store.\n\n## Overview\n\n- Theme-private endpoints live under `/api/qingpu/**`.\n- Async jobs reuse the shared `qingpu_tasks` table instead of creating tool-specific task ledgers.\n- Generated outputs are written into `qingpu_assets` so they automatically appear in "My Creations".\n\n---\n\n## 1. Submit Text-to-Image Task\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tools/text-to-image/generate`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "prompt": "Cyberpunk city street at night, rainy neon reflections, cinematic framing",\n  "negativePrompt": "blurry, duplicate, low quality",\n  "referenceUrl": "https://example.com/reference.png",\n  "modelName": "Flux.1 Pro",\n  "size": "1792x1024",\n  "quality": "high",\n  "profileId": "imgp_demo",\n  "format": "PNG",\n  "steps": 30,\n  "modePreset": "Quality"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "taskId": 123,\n    "productId": "tool:tool:text-to-image",\n    "scope": "tool:text-to-image",\n    "enqueued": true,\n    "reason": null\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- `taskId` is nullable when the same dedupe key is already queued or running.\n- `size`, `quality`, and `profileId` override the user\'s saved Qingpu image model defaults.\n- The server persists tool metadata like `prompt`, `toolLabel`, and `source` into `qingpu_assets.meta`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Poll Shared Qingpu Tasks\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/tasks`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n- `scope` (optional): filter by task payload scope, such as `tool:text-to-image`\n- `type` (optional): filter by task type, such as `tool_image_generate`\n- `limit` (optional): number of rows to return, default `20`, max `100`\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "active": true,\n    "items": [\n      {\n        "id": 123,\n        "type": "tool_image_generate",\n        "productId": "tool:tool:text-to-image",\n        "title": "Cyberpunk city street at night",\n        "scope": "tool:text-to-image",\n        "status": "running",\n        "progress": 45,\n        "stage": "tool-image:queued",\n        "error": null,\n        "resultUrl": null,\n        "resultAssetId": null,\n        "attempts": 0,\n        "updatedAt": "2026-07-23T02:01:23.000Z"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- `active=true` means at least one queued or running task matches the filter.\n- `resultUrl` and `resultAssetId` are populated after the task succeeds.\n- Existing listing workbench tasks and tool tasks share the same ledger, but can be separated by `scope` or `type`.\n';export{e as default};
